# R8 runs on release builds (AGP 9.3+: `optimization { enable = true }` in app/build.gradle.kts). That also shrinks resources.
# AGP adds its default Android rules, and everything named in AndroidManifest.xml (activities, the InCallService, the receiver)
# is kept automatically. This app uses no reflection, so there are no -keep rules to write.
#
# For more details, see https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# Keep source file + line numbers. Diag's crash breadcrumb logs the top stack frames, e.g. "a.b.c(SourceFile:12)".
# In a release build those names are obfuscated; to read one, put it in a file as "at <frame>" and run:
#   retrace app/build/outputs/mapping/release/mapping.txt that-file.txt
# (retrace ships with the Android SDK command-line tools). Keep each release's mapping.txt, it only matches that build.
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
